      "No self-escalation or granting above delegation ceiling",
      "HRD organizational authority does not imply finance transaction authority",
      "No frontend role switcher in production",
      "Revocation invalidates authorization at next request and session policy as defined",
      "Supervisor cannot gain additional outlet by editing grant"
